  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yangambi Engagement Landscape (YEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide funding and support to the CIFOR-ICRAF&#x2019;s intervention in the Yangambi Engagement Landscape with the key objectives to: 
- Slow down deforestation and forest degradation through an adoption of non-harmful practices, improving the biodiversity of the landscape.
- To improve human well-being through increased sustainable production and access to alternative sources of income, including employment.
- To improve the local economic fabric through long-term commitment, effective management and direct and indirect benefits of conservation. 
The overall outcome of the project is to preserve biodiversity and improve governance and the standard of living of populations in the Yangambi Landscape through sustainable management of natural resources based on sound practices of conservation, development and support for the local economic fabric.</narrative>
  </description>
